 "profile": {
  "paragraphs": [
   "Soter Technologies sells sensor technology and software. The FS286 unit is a vape smoke detection, cigarette smoke detection, and anti-bullying product. The FS300 is the 8th generation of that product and adds a cloud-based portal. A partnership with Airthings for Business supplies Indoor Air Quality monitors.",
   "The detectors go into schools and other public spaces, including restrooms and locker rooms where monitoring is harder. They flag vaping, bullying, and device tampering in areas where cameras are prohibited. Notifications carry the time and location of the event and reach staff by text or email. Device sensitivity and the subscriber list are changed through the FlySense Dashboard.",
   "The buyers named on these pages are school districts, in partnerships counted across all 50 states and 30 countries. The alerts are routed to school administrators, security personnel, or other designated authorities."
  ],
